{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受词有时偏概括，缺少X那种细腻的层次变化、具体的音乐细节和准确的乐句时点对应。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为一边听琴一边扫屏幕的普通观众，我会选Y：左右分区让我比较自然地先抓住人物在想什么，再顺手感受右侧的情绪，不必频繁跟随密集的文字切换；而且人物的动机、顾虑和心理转折交代得更连贯。X的关键词高亮和分时出现的感受确实更有音乐性，细节也丰富得多，但阅读任务明显更重，部分解释还改变了原有的心理因果，尤其S13把无人能保证永远的顾虑转成了相处越喜欢、越觉得时间快，削弱了前后逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "163415a1-09af-4066-b13c-5de61cb9dd14", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164723684498Z", "elapsed_seconds": 130.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:49:34.575411+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff7f59db4f93f3de9b11c3fcf10cccfab29fb0dfd736c4c06f60eb02fa1fed64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g